  "description": "A fictional SEAD raid on the battery in its prepared position (roadmap E6). Hunters with anti-radiation missiles that remember the radar for 20 s come with the strike aircraft, and a stand-off jammer barrages the VHF nets. The crew radiates the search radar in short bursts; the PU-12 reads the targets out on the battery net; the post's air observers call every ARM launch they see ('Всем! Пуск ПРР!'), which gives the crew the time to go silent past the missile's memory. After each engagement the vehicle stows and drives to its next alternate position (shoot and scoot), so an ARM fired at where it radiated finds it gone. The NPC commanders run the battery and the crew; take any seat, or command the vehicle.",
